Numbers:
    int: a
    int: b
    int: c
    int: d
    int: e
    return: int
    add:
        return: (+ a b c d e)

Example:
    return: @
    run:
        throws: copy(asOperand\throws)
        @: myOp asOperand(Numbers\add; sys\priority("+"))
        return: ((myOp 1 2 3 4 5); (1 myOp 2 3 4 5))
